package ease

// Stateless progress curves. Pass progress in [0, 1]; inputs are not clamped.
// Back and Elastic can exceed [0, 1]. These curves store no time or velocity.
// Endpoints are exact, including where trigonometric rounding would change them.
//
// Adapted for Chibi from Odin core:math/ease, with explicit endpoint guards:
// https://github.com/odin-lang/Odin/blob/7e313bd6f1fa9ae887c7b522611481cbf2da4cac/core/math/ease/ease.odin
// Odin's equations originate in Warren Moore's public-domain AHEasing:
// https://github.com/warrenm/AHEasing
